<title>DUBAI: SAfrica's Deputy President Mbeki visits Saudi.</title>
<headline>SAfrica's Deputy President Mbeki visits Saudi.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Deputy President Thabo Mbeki arrived in Saudi Arabia on Friday, the official Saudi Press Agency said.</p>
<p>The agency report, issued late on Friday, gave no details on the purpose of his visit.</p>
</text>
